## Context

Before running the full Experiment 1 sweep, three design decisions must be
explicitly resolved and committed. Writing the Annex A spec first (done) made
the open questions visible.

## Actions

1. **Prompt**: confirm `base.txt` is the final Experiment 1 prompt. Decide whether
   the "Épouvantail" slide frame keeps `prompt_extract.txt` as the strawman or is
   updated to `base.txt`. Update `slides/slides.tex` accordingly.

2. **Model set**: confirm `modelset_ablation_journal` is the right set. Check whether
   any model in the set has been retired or renamed since the set was defined.
   Update experiments.toml `sweep_ablation_p1_direct_base` to use it.

3. **Temperature**: confirm T=0 for all runs. Verify that `seed=42` is set in the
   sweep config. Note in Annex A which providers ignore seed (document as a
   limitation, not a blocker).

## Exit criteria

- [ ] Decision on `prompt_extract.txt` vs `base.txt` for the slides "Épouvantail" frame documented in a log entry here
- [ ] `sweep_ablation_p1_direct_base` points to `modelset_ablation_journal` with `temperature = 0.0` and `seed = 42`
- [ ] No retired model IDs in the journal model set
- [ ] Annex A in `slides/manuscript/main.md` updated if any design decision changed
